2 CONT
2 CONT His father was bailiff and Danish. Mora was the Swedish / Norwegian adelsætta Haard. Budde on Humlevik / Gjersvik Paths. NST, bands 16, booklet 1. <nowiki>--------------------</nowiki> Ættarbok from Granby
2 CONT
2 CONT Folkedal 48
2 CONT
2 CONT -------------------- Data found on http://slekt.krypinn.net/index.php. Family tree for families Lone Sjur Sæter:
