1 NAME Brynhild /Tordsdatter Benkestok/
2 GIVN Brynhild
2 SURN Tordsdatter Benkestok
2 NICK Brøndelle Bechestak af Hananger
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE BET 1559 AND 1562
