1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Björn Svensson Store==
2 CONT
2 CONT Sven Store. Issued Haganäs against Trollåsa in Håcksviks SN/P, which he obtained with his wife1. His seal shows the store gun (However, the star is unclear). Can possibly be identical to Gallowglass Sven Tordsson as 1434-06-21 app
2 CONC ear as Sigillbeseglare1 (The seal gone). According to the family books, his widow was married to a Lasse Tordsson Whose son Tord Larsson had his daughter Kerstin , who was Married to Birger bertil Lilliehöök and Jöns Tordsson (Anr
2 CONC ep, Tab. 19).2
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Spouse==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married:''' Kerstin Johansdotter,'''
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Children:==
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Tord Svensson Store Squire''' married Kerstin Bengtsdotter Krabbe?
2 CONT * '''Kerstin Björnsdotter Store'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' Adelsvapen, Store No 79, Noble - https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Store_nr_79#TAB_3
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Tillägg, Rättelser och Slutord, Volume 4 - https://books.google.com/books?id=3H9EYXYctToC&pg=PA218&lpg=PA218&dq=Tord+Svensson+Store&source=bl&ots=CGJiO9zVvR&sig=ACfU3U0pvEbn1uDQw-DNejC7loPbKudIZg&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwje8NzSzqHj
2 CONC AhXCjp4KHXWSAU04ChDoATALegQIBxAB#v=onepage&q=Tord%20Svensson%20Store&f=false
2 CONT * Store  Blå ætten - http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/svenske/Store/Store.htm
