2 CONT * Daughter of Erland Petersson, till Handelö (Bååt) and Gertrud Birgersdotter (Sparre af Fyllingarum) 
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/B%C3%A5%C3%A5t_nr_3#TAB_9 Boat Noble No. 3, by Adelsvapen]
2 CONT
2 CONT Erland Peterson (son of Peter.Jonsson, Tab. 8), to Händelö in St. Johannis parish, Östergötland county and Fituna in Sorunda parish, Stockholm county, which he inherited through his wife. Named's gunsmith 1455-02-21, but became a 
2 CONC knight at Kristian I's coronation in 1457. Lived on Händelö 1470 and still 1481, but was dead in 1490. Married around 1470 to Gertrud Birgersdotter in her 1st marriage, daughter of the gunsmith and district chief in Hammarkind Bir
2 CONC ger Nilsson (sparre), to Fyllingarum, and Brita Isaksdotter ( Banér ).
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Brita Erlandsdotter.''' Married 1493-07-07 to the Riksrådet and the lawyer in Tiohärad's law saga Bengt Abiörnsson (Liljesparre ).
2 CONT * '''Henrik Erlandsson.''' Riksråd  to Fyllingarum in Ringarums parish, Östergötland county, which he probably inherited from his mother's family and where he lived in 1511 and later until his death. Was district chief in Hammarki
2 CONC nd 1511-06-10 and gunsmith and national councilor 1512-01-19. Lagman in Östergötland 1523-06-06. Sealed in 1527 among the national council Västerås recess. Married to Elin , probably daughter of the knight Ulf Pedersson (rose) to 
2 CONC Ervalla and Birgitta Jönsdotter (lion face).
2 CONT * '''Peder Erlandsson.''' Riksråd. Died 1540. the elder (son of Erland Pedersson, Tab. 9), to Fituna in Sorunda parish and Ultsunda in Bromma parish both in Stockholm county. Squire. Riksråd. 1523-06-03–1529-06-24. Lagman on Öland
2 CONC . Slottslofven at Stockholm's castles 1529, 1531 and 1538. Died 1540-05-30. Married to Märta Björnsdotter in her 2nd marriage, daughter of Björn Jönisson (Pukehorn) and Brita Månsdotter ( Three roses ).
2 CONT
2 CONT =The Swedish Diplomatarium's Main Catalog of Medieval Letters=
2 CONT
2 CONT ==SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=+Birgitta+Erlandsdotter+B%C3%A5%C3%A5t+&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=1&postid=sdhk_32772&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''32772''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1492 July 2'''
2 CONT * '''Place of issue: Linköping'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Peter Erlandsson (Bååt) leases the well-born Sven Bengt Abjörnsson and his sister Birgitta Erlandsdotter their share in Händelö farm for consideration of other estates, but with the condition that the exchange goes back if Händelö
2 CONC  were to be inherited outside the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT =Birgitta Erlandsdotter Bååt=
