2 CONC . Prot. 12 Kugelberg, First life grenadier regiment's history (1930). 13 Sat. 14 Db for the Eastern District (HF). 15 At (S). 16 GIrs. 17 SAB. 18 El.19 Östra, härads dombok on 11 July 1685 (OÄ). 20 Lie down. 21 Message of Västra L
2 CONC jungfors. 22 Message by P. Married Vejde. 23 Eastern härads dombok (OA). 24 Ka, Broken property files no. 200
