2 DATE 3 MAY 1590
2 PLAC Reval
2 ADDR
3 CITY Tallinn
3 STAE Harju County
3 CTRY Estonia
1 BURI
2 DATE 8 MAY 1590
2 PLAC Tallinna, Tallinn
2 ADDR
