2 CONT =Debate if Elin Jakobsdotter was from the Baat Family=
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Through extensive research from direct line descendants, we have found 3 sources to prove Elin Jakobsdotter was a Baat.  Recently Kjell Magnell in his essay "Pelle i Ramstad, Stårckarna och Elin Jakobsdotter" (Släkt och Hävd 19
2 CONC 65, pp 397-420).  He demonstrated that Elin Jakobsdotter was not from the Baat Family.  
2 CONT
2 CONT This essay has created a debate on the parents of Elin Jakobsdotter Baat:  Here’s three main sources that proves she is the daughter of Jakob Jacobson Snakenborg and Holmfrid Pedersdotter Pik. In the Elgienstierna "The indoctrinat
2 CONC ed Swedish nobility's pedigrees". Volume VIII p.70 it says that Lennart Svenske was married to Elin Jakobsdotter Bååt, daughter of  Demonstrated by Kjell Magnell in the essay "Pelle i Ramstad, Stårckarna och Elin Jakobsdotter" (Sl
2 CONC äkt och Hävd 1965, pp 397-420). According to Magnell, Lennart Svenske was married to Elin Jakobsdotter, who was the daughter of Jacob Jonsson of Lång, Grums (S) and his wife Holmfrid Pedersdotter. In the essay it appears that Holm
2 CONC frid's husband was the deceased rider Jakob Jonsson i Lång, who was of unknown origin.  '''THIS IS TOTALLY INCORRECT!'''
2 CONT
2 CONT *   '''1st Main Source:'''  shows Elin Jacobsson Baat used her son-in-law Major Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud of Västergötland, Nr.199 Seal to exchange of goods with Carl Bonde on 1633-07-02 in Karlstad (no. 32).  Year and number: 1633 
2 CONC Register: Letter writer register - The National Archives' individual archives and collections from The National Archives' official archive (collective records) in Sweden.
2 CONT *  '''2nd Main Source:'''  is consistent with '''Source: Svenska adelns Ättar-taflor utgifna af Gabriel Anrep, Volume 1, By Gabriel Anrep, Tab 20, page 368.''' shows Elin Jakobsdotter Baat is the daughter of Jakob Jacobson Snakenb
2 CONC org and Holmfrid Pedersdotter Pik.  Elin married Ryttmastaren Lennart Pedersson Svenske, till Satra. 
2 CONT * '''3rd Main Source.''' Holmfrid Pedersdotter Pik Sister Margareta Persdotter, who died childless in Bro around 1629 and [https://start.varmlandsrotter.se/varmlandsanor/artiklar/1999_1/ '''Elin Jacobsdotter Snakeborg Bååt, wife o
2 CONC f master rider Lennart Persson Svenske, was registered as the nearest heir.''']
2 CONT
