2 DATE 29 MAR 1604
2 PLAC Ulvsnäs
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Tenhult
3 CITY Jönköping
3 STAE Småland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
2 DATE 20 MAY 1604
