1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Carl Paulin Lilliengrip=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Petrus Paulinus Hilletan and Botilda Jönsdotter Falk 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Lilliengrip_nr_1212 Noble family Lilliengrip no. 1212, by Adelsvapen Genealogies]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Carl Paulin,''' ennobled Lilliengrip (son of Petrus Paulinus, see noble family Hilletan, Tab. 2). Customs officer in Malmö. Commissioner in Färs and Frosta districts of Landskrona county in 1677. Inspector at the alum mill in S
2 CONC kåne. District chief in Ingelstads, Herrestads, Färs and Frosta districts in 1689. Knighted 1690-09-10 (introduced in 1693 under no. 1212). Lived in 1697, but was dead before 1702-11-12. 'During the Malmö siege and storming by the
2 CONC  Danes in 1677, he, along with other civilians, took up arms and was entrusted with the bastion at Syndre port, which he bravely defended with seven cannons, a cadet constable and two soldiers. Often participated in parties agains
2 CONC t the Snapphans and the rebellious common people in Skåne and made considerable advances to the crown from their own funds.' '''Married to Eleonora NN, born 1644, died 1716 and buried 1716-03-03 in Alingsås.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Caspar Petrus.''' Student in Lund 1687-06-06. Commander of the Dowager Queen's Regiment of Foot. Driver at the Queen's Life Regiment 1693. Dismissal 1694-05-24. Lifedrabant 1703-10-28. Resignation 1705-02-22. Lieutenant colon
2 CONC el in King Stanislaus of Poland's horse guard in 1703. Captured by the Russians on 10/14/1703 in Praga near Warschau. Came home in 1710. Died unmarried in 1721 at the end of the year (according to another information 1715-09-06) S
2 CONC medstorp
2 CONT * '''Gustaf Carl,''' born 1680 in Skåne. Student in Lund 1687-06-06. Volunteer at the Swedish infantry regiment 1698-08-06. Driver at the life dragoon regiment 1700-03-00. Sergeant at the dragoon regiment 1702-03-12. Field sergean
2 CONC t 1703-06-00. Cornet 1704-05-03. Confirmation power of attorney 1704-08-09. Lieutenant 11/16/1706. Followed the king to Bender. Second captain 1716-03-26. Premier captain 1716-07-27. Farewell. Premier captain again 1724-02-22. Die
2 CONC d unmarried 1727-06-26 in Stockholm during the Riksdag and ended the family.
2 CONT * '''Eleonora,''' died 1705. Married 1696-06-12 in Ystad to the mayor of Alingsås Ulrik Jakobsson Paulin, born 1670, died 1758-04-12 on his property Hallen vid Alingsås.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Hilletan_nr_1022 Noble family Hilletan no. 1022, by Adelsvapen Genealogies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Petrus Paulinus''' (son of Paulus Erici, Tab. 1), vicar of Hinneryd in 1634 1 . Lived on his own farm Lihult. Died 1669 before 14/6. '''Married to Botilda Jonsdotter , who was still alive in 1671, daughter of the bailiff at Tof
2 CONC taholm Jöns Joensson (brother of lieutenant colonel Peder Joensson, knighted Gyllensvärd ).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT
