1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Karin Gustavsdotter (Stenbock)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Gustaf Olsson Stenbock, till Toftaholm and Ingrid Bengtsdotter (Vinstorp)   
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897399627&photo_id=6000000137104902873&position=0 '''Peder Hakansson, till Hagelsrum,'''] son of Hakan Hand, till Wi i Loths Socken Ostergothland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Nils Pedersson;''' Fick i Wadstena Got in Wadstena 1508, St. Gertud's day. of the Riksforestandaren Svante Sture freedom and boldness and to the arms a white hand in a red fell. (On [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gertrude_of_
2 CONC Nivelles St. Gerdrud's say] (1508-03-17) in Vadstena, the Regent of Sweden, [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svante_Nilsson_(regent_of_Sweden% Svante Nilsson], granted Nils Pedersson a [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fr%C3%A4lse fräl
2 CONC se] privilegion as well as the right to bear a coat-of-arms of a white hand against red background). Fick i [https://www.geni.com/projects/Municipality-of-Vadstena-Ostrogothia-Sweden/1898796 Wadstena] 1508, [https://sv.wikipedia.o
2 CONC rg/wiki/Gertrud_av_Nivelles S:t Gertruda dag] (17 mars) af Riksföreståndaren [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Svante_Nilsson_(Sture%29 Svante Sture] frihet och [https://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fr%C3%A4lse frälse] same en vapen en [htt
2 CONC ps://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hand_(sl%C3%A4kt%29 hvit hand i rödt fält]. 
2 CONT *''' Peder Pedersson, till Hagalsrum,''' (son of Peder Håkansson, Tab. 1), to Hagelsrum in Målilla parish and Ca) mare county and Dansjö in Lekaryd parish and Kronoberg county. Married Christina Håkansdotter, af Wångaslägten; daug
2 CONC hter of the Höfvidsmannen in Westeråa Håkan Svensson (Bölja or Strömfelt), to Bodshult, who carried three currents in the coat of arms, with Anna; King Carl Knutsson's (Farmer) daughter, with his 3rd wife, Christina Abrahamsdotter
2 CONC .  See [http://runeberg.org/anrep/2/0200.html Tab. 2]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Source''' [http://runeberg.org/anrep/2/0200.html Swedish nobility's tables / Department 2. Granfelt from Dal - Mörner af Tuna / 196]
2 CONT
