1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Ingegärd Pedersdotter=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Peter Andersson, väpnare i Möne and N.N.
2 CONT * Född:	1380 Intorp, Gällstad, Västergötland, Sverige 
2 CONT * Död:	före 1438 Länghem, Västergötland, Sverige (Sweden)
2 CONT * Hustru till Nils Gylta och Arvid Jönsson (Sparre över Stjärna) 
2 CONT * Moder till Gunnar Nilsson Gylta till Påtorp; Knut Arvidsson, till Torpa (Sparre över Stjärna); Arvid Arvidsson (Drake av Intorp); Christiern Drake af Västbo och Knut 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=6000000003897563080&photo_id=6000000176265083907&position=0 '''Geneology of Prika | Anbytarforum''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/6000000004647676194?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000176264999903 '''Arvid Jönsson'''] (son of Jöns Bengtsson, born about 1376, at the latest 1438. Chief of Staff. Squire. He stil
2 CONC l carried the same weapon as the father ('sparre' i.e chevron) in 1412-05-26, but 1421-05-03 and later 'sparre över stjärna' i.e chevron over a star.  Married before 1416 with Ingegärd Petersdotter , died most recently in 1438, da
2 CONC ughter of the gunner Peter Andersson ( Prika ) and Ingeborg Sigvidsdotter ( Ribbing ). '''Married before 1416 to Arvid Jönsson (there are shared opinions about whether this belonged to the family Drake af Intorp or Torpaätten ), t
2 CONC he governor of Ås county , later Kinds county. [12]   After the marriage, Arvid Jönson appears to call himself Arvid Jönsson in Möne or Arvid Prybeca and integrates the Pikaättens star into his chevron coat of arms 1421, when Drak
2 CONC e af Intorp .'''
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children with Arvid Jönsson=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Knut Arvidsson''' Circuit judge. Died 1459. Knut Arvidsson (son of Arvid Jönsson, Tab. 2 ). to Torpa in Länghems parish, Älvsborg County. Called Arms 1438-12-14. Chief of Kinds in the reign of another 1458. Death 1459 (RHKn.)
2 CONC . Married in 1439 to Kerstin Bengtsdotter (Kompan) , lived widow in 1459, daughter of the Dutch gunman Bengt Turesson ( Kompan , (chevron over leaf) and Märta Gunnarsdotter ( Gylta ).
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Arvid Arvidsson, Squire'''. Did farm change (RHKn.) With his brother Knut Arvidsson 1457-09-25. Lived in 1490. Married 1477-07-14 (morning gift aka dowry) at Högalöv in Uråsa parish, Kronoberg county, when he gave a mill in I
2 CONC ntorp and a farm in Risatorp, both in Gällstads parish, Älvsborg county and Långhult in Burseryds parish, Jönköping county in morning gift (RHKn.), with Ingegärd Gregersdotter, daughter of Gregers Svensson ( Sparre i Värend ) and 
2 CONC NN Nilsdotter (Balk av Billa)
2 CONT
2 CONT == SDHK No: [https://sok.riksarkivet.se/?Sokord=Gylta&EndastDigitaliserat=false&AvanceradSok=False&page=11&postid=sdhk_14620&tab=post&FacettState=undefined%3Ac%7C#tab '''14620''']
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Dating: 1396 July 25'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Gunnar Gylta admits to having received Ingeborg's, Peter Prika's widow's estate in Halland, for "at the skula thes wtermer i heign ok frethe bliuæ" and not for a mortgage or money.
2 CONT
