2 CONC our God daughter" and we will also participate in baptism as proof of their friendship (daughter grace never reached adulthood). After the death of Jöns, Beata Gyllensvärd partly farmed the arch in Dalsland, she renamed according 
2 CONC to Vasastil the farm Röksberg Haque in Småland. Yard Bow was located about 3 km south of Laxarby Church at Salmon Lake's northeastern shore (älvsborg County). 
