2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Rystad
3 CITY Linköping
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 MAY 1710
2 PLAC Näs
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Bjurbäck
3 CITY Mullsjö
3 STAE Västergötland
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
2 DATE 6 MAY 1710
2 PLAC Bottnaryd Church
