1 NAME Peder Lindormsson /Ribbing af Zernava/
2 GIVN Peder Lindormsson
2 _MARNM Ribbing af Zernava
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 10 JUN 1606
2 PLAC Vadstena, Östergötlands län, Sverige
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 APR 1664
2 PLAC Stockholm, Stockholms län, Sverige
2 ADDR
1 BURI
2 DATE 9 OCT 1664
