1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Katarina Helvik Lauritsdatter Galtung
2 CONT
2 CONT Fdt omkring 1635.
2 CONT
2 CONT Dd 1693, Eidfjord i Hardanger, 58 1/4 Aar gl.1.
2 CONT
2 CONT Datter af Laurids Johannesen Galte og Lisbeth Ottesdatter Orning.
2 CONT
2 CONT Brn af Anders Andersen Riber og Katarina Helvik Lauritsdatter Galtung:
2 CONT
2 CONT 2.1. Laurits Andersen Riber, f. 1658, d. 1709 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3.1. Johannes Andersen Riber, d. omkr. 1730 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4.1. Anna Katarina Andersdatter Riber 
2 CONT
2 CONT 5.1. Anders Andersen Riber, f. 1663 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6.1. Peder Andersen Riber, f. 1676, d. 1721 
2 CONT
2 CONT 7.1. Elisabeth Maria Andersdatter Riber 
2 CONT
2 CONT 8.1. Mtta Andersdatter Riber 
2 CONT
2 CONT As translated from the "Gards- og ttesoge for Eidfjord" After her husband, the priest, Anders Anderson Riber's death, Katrina lived for the rest of her life at their farm, Lgreid Nedre, "Prestegarden" (which it's still called toda
2 CONC y) in Eidfjord, Hordaland
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------
