1 NOTE {geni:about_me} He got a part of Indre Håland from his brother Gotskalk. Hans bought the farm at Frette for 124 rdlr off Elias Eliasen from Skånevik in 1711, but didn't move there until 1723. Just two years later he died. 
2 CONT
