1 NOTE {geni:about_me} [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tillbakaseende_ulv#TAB_20 '''Sten Bengtsson''' (Tillbakaseende Ulv)]. Uppträder tidigast 1527. Blev 13.8 1534 häradshövding i Södra Möre hd i Småland, vilket han sannolikt var 
2 CONC till 23.7 1537. Nämnes 1545-1553 som häradshövding i Gräsgårds hd på Öland och ånyo i Södra Möre. Hans sätesgård var Stävlö i Åby sn, Norra Möre hd i Småland. Dog mellan 16.2 och 25.7 1554. Uppges ha gift sig 20.7 1533 med Kerstin
2 CONC  Anundsdotter, som ärvde jord i Aska, Bobergs, Hanekinds, Vifolka och Ydre hd i Östergötland, Glanshammars och Mellösa hd i Närke, Konga och Uppvidinge hd i Småland samt Vilske hd i Västergötland och var dotter av Anund Jönsson (U
2 CONC lfsax) och Karin Hansdotter (Tott). 1556 rymde hon till Tyskland med tysken Jöran pipare.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Anund Stensson, 1560, died in 1580, rider, commander. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Claus Stensson. Owned 1562 land in Rönö hd in Södermanland and Södra Möre hd in Småland. Fänrik at Östgöta rider by 1564. Dumped in the battle at Svartrå or Axtorna in Halland 20.10 1565.
2 CONT
2 CONT Anna Stensdotter. Had yet 1590 Stävlö in Åby sn. Norra Möre hd, as the seat farm. Was possibly dead in 1591, the task that she would have lived yet 1600 could not be verified. She was buried in Åby church. Married recently in 1570
2 CONC  with Johan Siggeson ( Svartingstorpsätten ), born in Birsta in Sköns sn in Medelpad, had been over the king's inheritance and own in Östergötland west of 1557-1558, received the tent of Vista and Tveta hd in Småland in 1558, had 
2 CONC been in Boberg hd in Östergötland and in Möre in 1561-1564, became the chief of the ruling in Lysings hd in Östergötland 3.3 1558, was the chief of the East Hd in Småland in 1562 and in Åkerbo hd in Öland 1563-1565, became the chi
2 CONC ef of command 10.6 1564 brought maybeers who would enter Norway and chief commander of the troops in Norrland 6.1 1565 entitled Folders, was Swedish lawman in the occupied Norwegian landscape of Jämtland and Härjedalen from 15.12 
2 CONC 1564, in Härjedalen until 1565 but in Jämtland until 1571, the ruler of Vadstena Castle and city became 13.11 1571, was escaped 25.9 1572, was written in 1569 to an unspecified Söderby, but at least from 1574 to Svartingstorp in Å
2 CONC by sn, Norra Möre hd in Småland, where He in 1571 received a crown home, and died between 19.5 1579 and 1.1 1581.
2 CONT
2 CONT Karin Stensdotter. Written in 1579 to Kyrketorp in Kläckeberga sn. Norra Möre hd in Småland but 1.1 1581 to a difficult location Askö, 1583 and 1600 to Horsö in Kläckeberga and 1605 to Stävlö in Åby sn. Norra Möre hd. Can not be p
2 CONC ut to life after 1605 and died in 1611. First married to Hans Gedhardt von Lewenstein , who lived yet 1576, then with Jakob Björnsson (Boat) who would have died before 1.11581, and finally in Kalmar 6.71589 with Christoffer Anders
2 CONC son ( Gyllengrip ), which was probably born in 1518, where the king's chamberfather 1561 and chamber servant in 1562 became the captain of the war 19.2 1563, the captain of the war people in Stockholm 1.11 1563 and underamiral 18.
2 CONC 5 1564, 1564-1571 were Danish prisoners, then Hov-junkers, 1578 the princess Elisabet's chieftain, attended Borgholm 1579-1584 and at Kalmar 1587-1590, and chieftain in Algutsrums and Förbohd in Öland 1579-1583 and in Norra Möre 1
2 CONC 589-1599 and formerly married 10.11 1577 at Uppsala Castle with Gertrud Ulfsdotter ( Boat ), which died 19.4 1588. His seat was 1573-1577 Boatorp in Moheda sn. Allbo hd but from 1578 Stensnäs in Ryssby sn, Sunnerbo hd. Hacked in K
2 CONC almar 16.5 1599.
