0 @N6000000002577224455@ NOTE !NOTES:
1 CONT 1- 18 Aug 1993: Data is from the records of Owen B Anderson.
1 CONT 2- I have found out that the name SMALAND is the name of a province
1 CONT in the center portion of Sweden which comprises the counties of Kalmar,
1 CONT Jonkoping, and Kronoberg. The use of this name does not point to a parish or
1 CONT county and the first place name is generaly a farm or village within the
1 CONT parish.
0 @N6000000006127971327@ NOTE born 24 August 1612, died 9 December 1668 at Djulö, buried Stora Malms Church, Co. Södermanland, married 26 March 1637 Carin Gyllenhorn (buried 9 March 1670 Riddarholms Church, Stockholm, translated to Stora Malms Church), daughte
1 CONC r of JosuaGyllenhorn and Gertrud Mauritzdotter Laxman.
0 @N6000000000945026987@ NOTE Eide Ulvstorp og Hönsäter. Han fikk i forlening Varnhems klosters landbor i 1537 som han mistet i 1543 da han i vederlag fikk  kirkelandbor i Kåkinds härad; fogd i Uppland 1552-54; fogd i Östersysslet i Värmland 1554-61; hövedsman
1 CONC n over knekter fra Värmland og Dal i 1556. Forseglet Gustaf Vasas testamente 1560 og stendenes bevilling 1561. Ryttmester for en fana i Västgöta 1561. Falt  utenfor Halmstad i 1563 under danskefeiden. Källa: "Den introducerade sve
1 CONC nska adelns ättartavlor" av Gustaf Elgenstierna.
